## Delta warehouse Apply button and status fix

Context: The status line always showed the global warehouse name because it used
``effective_delta_warehouse_id`` (global fallback) instead of the saved
``delta_warehouse_id``. Domain Save does not persist this instance setting.

Changes:

1. `settings.html` / `settings.js`
   Add **Apply** button next to the Delta warehouse dropdown; posts to
   ``/settings/select-delta-warehouse`` and writes registry ``global_config``.
   Status line reflects the saved Delta override vs global fallback.
2. `SettingsService.select_delta_warehouse`
   Allow clearing the override (empty string); force-reload global config cache.

